				.. "Roblox interface library made the slow way: one request "
				.. "at a time, tested after every change, and rewritten "
				.. "whenever it was not good enough. Thank you for the "
				.. "patience, the corrections and the good taste. This one "
				.. "belongs to both of us."
		)
		Hero:Info(
			"14 themes - 109 songs - a 24 hour key system - a Gemini window "
				.. "- a full universal suite - free emotes on startup."
